//- Unified hero metrics — Key Metrics + Impact Snapshot
section(class="metrics-block" aria-label="Key metrics and impact snapshot")
	p(class="metrics-section-label") Key Metrics
	div(class="metrics-top-grid")
		div(class="metric-card")
			p(class="metric-number") 15+
			p(class="metric-label") Years Professional
		div(class="metric-card")
			p(class="metric-number") 1M+
			p(class="metric-label") Monthly Users
		div(class="metric-card")
			p(class="metric-number") 12→6
			p(class="metric-label") Month Rebrand
		div(class="metric-card")
			p(class="metric-number") 25
			p(class="metric-label") Engineers Led
	div(class="metrics-divider")
	div(class="metrics-bottom-grid")
		div(class="metric-detail")
			p(class="metric-number-sm") 12→6 mo
			p(class="metric-sublabel") BetUS Rebrand
			p(class="metric-description") Cut a planned 12-month platform rebrand to 6 months with React, Remix, and Strapi.
		div(class="metric-detail")
			p(class="metric-number-sm") 1M+
			p(class="metric-sublabel") Platform Scale
			p(class="metric-description") Supported 1M+ monthly users on high-traffic BetUS / BetAnything web platforms.
		div(class="metric-detail")
			p(class="metric-number-sm") Jest
			p(class="metric-sublabel") RTL · Cypress
			p(class="metric-description") Established production testing standards across high-traffic delivery workflows.
